title: Loop_DayEnding
---
Narrator: The day closes. Prince carries today's conversations and insights into tomorrow.
<<loop_sequence_complete>>
===

title: Loop_DayEnding_A1_D1
---
Narrator: Night settles over the city.
Prince: I made choices today. Tomorrow I will find out which ones stayed with me.
<<loop_sequence_complete>>
===

title: Loop_DayEnding_A1_D2
---
Narrator: The first act closes.
Prince: I thought answers would make me lighter. They mostly made the questions clearer.
<<loop_sequence_complete>>
===

title: Loop_DayEnding_A2_D1
---
Narrator: Another day ends.
Prince: Munir cannot live my life for me. That may be why his words matter.
<<loop_sequence_complete>>
===

title: Loop_DayEnding_A2_D2
---
Narrator: Prince reaches the end of the final day.
Prince: I am not finished. But I am no longer standing where I began.
<<loop_sequence_complete>>
===

title: Loop_ActTransition
---
Narrator: Time passes, and a new act begins.
<<loop_sequence_complete>>
===

title: Loop_ActTransition_A2
---
Narrator: Act Two begins.
Narrator: Prince returns with questions shaped by what he chose, what he avoided, and what he learned.
<<loop_sequence_complete>>
