title: Loop_DemoEnding
---
Narrator: The demo is complete.
Narrator: Prince's available topics, discussed topics, relationship with Munir, act, day, and decision state all remained in the persistent GameSession.
Prince: I still have a road ahead of me. At least now I know how to take the next step.
<<loop_sequence_complete>>
